/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `D Γ _ _ Pl0 T A Ks _ _ _ R F _ G hG i j hi hj`. Consider the cases of `i with`. Consider the case `zero`. Rewrite using `[GlobalTheory.Grid.parV_zero D hj]`. Break down `j with _ | j` into its components or cases.

Both sides reduce to the same expression. Use `show (if j + 1 < D.R.m then GlobalTheory.Grid.nodeY R (j + 1) else GlobalTheory.Grid.nodeX R).S = _ split_ifs with h`. Simplify using `[Nat.min_eq_left hj]`. Establish `: j + 1 = D.R.m` using `by omega`. Rewrite using `[this]`.

