/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `D T L sc G θ X c F ⟨h1, h2, h3⟩`. Use `⟨Formalism.IndefR.Mult.isAutFunSm_smul _ _ h1 c, Formalism.IndefR.Mult.isCuspFun_smul _ h2 c, ?_⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Break down `X with ⟨i, j⟩ | i | j` into its components or cases. Introduce `τ`. Establish `e : (fun g => star ((c • F) g)) = star c • fun g => star (F g)`.

